Roadmap
-------

Planned work for future versions includes:

1. Refining the definition of "Compatible License" in Section 1.7.
2. Clarifying the interaction between Section 3.4 and licenses with
   stronger patent clauses, such as GPL-3.0.
3. Reviewing the replacement mechanism against the Open Source
   Definition and, if appropriate, preparing an OSI certification
   submission.
4. Adding more examples and compatibility analysis.
5. Considering whether to adopt a fixed list of compatible licenses as an
   alternative or supplement to the open-ended OSI anchor.

See ROADMAP.md for details.

